# MCP budget

- Project MCP: only `zarinpal-docs` (payment docs). Use when touching Zarinpal/payments.
- Nuxt UI MCP: only when building/editing `apps/web` UI components.
- Turn **off** unused user MCPs (Google Calendar, Drive, Browser, Figma) when not needed — tool schemas burn tokens every turn.
- Prefer reading a file over enabling a new MCP.
